// Foretold is a state of a card in exile: the card the foretell special action
// exiles, or one an effect says becomes foretold [CR#702.143c,702.143d]. The CR
// never calls foretold a designation; the registry carries it as one so
// "becomes foretold" and "foretold card" have a state to read.
Designation(
    name: "foretold",
    params: [],
    spelling: "foretold",
    scope: HeldBy(Object),
    effectful: true,
    zone: Exile,
)
